<title>USA: Clinton to meet Emir of Qatar June 11.</title>
<headline>Clinton to meet Emir of Qatar June 11.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton will meet the Emir of Qatar, Sheikhh Hamad bin Khalifa al-Thani, at the White House on June 11, a spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The two leaders will reaffirm their close bilateral ties and will review regional security issues, the Middle East peace process and the upcoming Middle East economic summit,&quot; White House spokesman Mike McCurry said in a statement.</p>
